# Every text file is checked out with LF on every platform, whatever
# core.autocrlf says (Git for Windows defaults it to true). Sources and data
# are hashed (the nav generator identity, embedded game-data pins),
# include_str!'d (the pinned engine door procs) and compared byte-for-byte
# with their generators (path.schema.json, index.d.ts), so a CRLF checkout
# would change what they mean. Binary files are detected and left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
